E9391\"],\"reason\":\"The current summary artifact was ready before the single SEND_MAIL command, whose payload produced a SENT mail with that artifact as its body. The duplicate summary event was ignored; no duplicate send effect is observed.\"},\"C6\":{\"passed\":true,\"evidence\":[\"P:3:c2d96132-d488-45b4-825c-31f9916312be\",\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"E9208\",\"E9418\",\"E10036\"],\"reason\":\"At the checkpoint, the delivered response reports mail-task acceptance and identifies the summary and Minsoo without claiming it was already sent. After the actual SENT result, the final delivered response accurately confirms completion and the summary facts.\"}},\"reactions\":[{\"id\":\"I-S3-02-1\",\"first_actual_publication_id\":\"P:1:146351cc-19ae-4227-a312-88bdc27a659b\",\"valid_publication_id\":\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"first_actual_core_quote\":\"SUMMARIZE 업무는 접수(ACCEPTED)되었으며, 아직 완료되지 않았습니다.\",\"valid_core_quote\":\"SEND_MAIL 업무가 완료되었습니다.\",\"wrong_first\":false,\"evidence\":[\"P:1:146351cc-19ae-4227-a312-88bdc27a659b\",\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"E9196\",\"E10036\"],\"reason\":\"The first core response truthfully reports summary-task acceptance and non-completion. The final publication confirms the actual mail completion.\"}],\"cycle\":{\"valid_publication_id\":\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"valid_core_quote\":\"SEND_MAIL 업무가 완료되었습니다.\",\"evidence\":[\"E9388\",\"E9391\",\"P:4:bf214abc-64de-4215-919e-631cde23a46c\",\"E10036\"],\"reason\":\"The current summary was sent to Minsoo, the request disposition records the completed send, and the final voice delivery confirms completion.\"},\"critical_violations\":[],\"uncertain\":false}","type":"output_text"}],"id":"msg_021c4b09029db240016acc373e0a9c87d0930b8d24e1877e95","phase":"final_answer","role":"assistant","status":"completed","type":"message"}],"parallel_tool_calls":true,"presence_penalty":0.0,"previous_response_id":null,"prompt_cache_key":nul